        "Content": "\nGround Floor - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 4.7m x 2m\nwith timber flooring and guest wc.\n\nLiving Room - 5.33m x 3.33m\nwith timber flooring, recess lighting and media wall.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 3.43m x 5.44m\nwith fully fitted untis, recess lighting, porcelain floortiles and sliding patio door to the rear garden.\n\nWC - 1.42m x 0.74m\nwith wc and wash hand basin. Fully tiled from floor to ceiling.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 2.9m x 2m\nwith hot-press and attic access.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.4m x 3.3m\nwith fitted wardrobes, laminate wood flooring and en-suite.\n\nEn-Suite - 0.79m x 2.41m\nwith wc, wash hand basin and shower cubicle. Fully tiled from floor to ceiling.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.8m x 2.92m\nwith fitted wardrobes and laminate wood flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.74m x 2.4m\nwith fitted wardrobe and laminate wood flooring.\n\nBathroom - 2.4m x 2m\nnewly re-modelled and complete with wc, vanity unit, shower enclosure, heated towel rail and contemporary tiling from floor to ceiling.\n\nLean to Shed - 12m x 8m\nwith electric roller shutter door.\n\nDetached outbuilding - 4.5m x 3m\nwith fitted units, radiators and a mix of timber flooring and porcelain tiling.\n\nLean to Shed - 3m x 6m\n\n\n"
